    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970407.0123\n\nSEOUL, April 7 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nSeoul shares close 1.1 percent higher\n\n\n\n\nShare prices rose 1.1 percent on the Korea Stock Exchange Monday as local institutional investors went on a buying spree ahead of a planned rise in the foreign shareholding ceiling, dealers said.\n\nThe composite index gained 7.48 points to finish at 694.90.",
